Shurpanakha angrily rebukes Ravana among ministers --- Shurpanakha brands lustful spy-less king shunned like mud --- Shurpanakha reports lone Rama slew fourteen thousand --- Shurpanakha reports Khara Dushana slain and Janasthana humbled --- Rama grants sages safety and secures Dandaka --- Shurpanakha praises vigilant grateful self-controlled lasting king --- Shurpanakha likens fallen kings to used garments --- Ravana ponders proclaimed faults long